cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this course, please cite it as below."
title: "INFO 521: Machine Learning Foundations — Course Hub"
abstract: >-
  The public course hub for INFO 521, Machine Learning Foundations, a
  7.5-week accelerated online graduate course at the University of Arizona
  College of Information Science. Renders the course website: syllabus,
  week-by-week schedule, assessment model, homework unit pages, project
  pages, discussion prompts, and open-licensed readings. Links four
  companion repositories: lecture slides, interactive activities, project
  materials, and homework materials. Homework solutions and quiz keys are
  held in a private repository and are not included here.
type: software
